                sqlQuery:
                    ```sql
                    SELECT DC.ID
                    FROM CMW_DESPACHOS_CABECERA DC
                    WHERE DC.NRO_DESPACHO = :P392_NRO_DESPACHO
                      AND DC.ID_EMPRESA   = :P0_ID_EMPRESA
                    ```
                itemsToSubmit: [
                    P392_NRO_DESPACHO
